    "articleHtml": "<p>A sleek, minimal template for designers, studios, and creatives. Quomi highlights your work, services, and story with balance and clarity — ready to customize and launch fast.</p><h2>My Approach</h2><p>With Quomi, my goal was to design a portfolio and agency template that doesn’t just display work — it <em>tells a story</em>. I approached it as a framework where design, storytelling, and functionality come together, allowing freelancers, studios, and agencies to express their unique identity with clarity and confidence. Quomi balances bold typography, clean layouts, and generous whitespace, ensuring that your work remains the true centerpiece.</p><h3>Vision and Innovation</h3><p>The vision for Quomi was to build a system that adapts to the diverse ways creatives present themselves. Light and dark themes offer flexibility, while slideshow and ticker features add dynamic motion to keep content engaging. Built with CMS collections, sticky scrolling, and workshop-powered code components, Quomi elevates the portfolio template beyond static pages — turning it into a living, interactive showcase that grows with your career or agency.</p><h3>Identifying Unique Challenges</h3><p>Creative professionals face the challenge of standing out in a saturated market while maintaining professionalism and usability. Portfolios can easily feel either too minimal (lacking personality) or too busy (distracting from the work). Quomi solves this by combining minimal structure with expressive elements: custom cursors, subtle effects, and layout templates that allow for both storytelling and functional clarity.</p><h3>Resolving Complex Problems</h3><p>Managing multiple services, projects, testimonials, and insights can feel overwhelming without the right system. Quomi resolves this with a modular CMS setup for services, projects, insights, testimonials, and legal content. This makes it easy to update, organize, and expand your site without breaking its design harmony. Sticky scrolling ensures intuitive navigation, while responsive layouts keep the experience consistent across desktop, tablet, and mobile.</p><h3>User-Centric Design</h3><p>At its core, Quomi was designed for users first. Visitors are guided through smooth journeys: from discovering who you are on the <strong>About</strong> page, to exploring your <strong>Services</strong> and <strong>Projects</strong>, to building trust through <strong>Testimonials</strong> and <strong>Insights</strong>. Every element is built for legibility, ease of navigation, and accessibility (A11y optimized), ensuring the site is usable by everyone — no matter their device or ability.</p><h3>Meeting User Needs</h3><p>Potential clients and collaborators want answers fast: What do you do? Why should they trust you? How do they get in touch? Quomi addresses these needs with dedicated pages for FAQs, clear service listings, testimonials that add credibility, and forms that streamline communication. It’s not just about presenting your work — it’s about reducing barriers and guiding visitors toward action.</p><h2>Detailed Pages and Features</h2><ul><li><p><strong>Home</strong> – A bold introduction to your brand and services with room for CTAs.</p></li><li><p><strong>About</strong> – Share your story, expertise, and mission in an authentic way.</p></li><li><p><strong>Services (CMS)</strong> – Dynamically highlight your offerings with flexible detail.</p></li><li><p><strong>Projects (CMS)</strong> – A structured showcase of your portfolio with filters and categories.</p></li><li><p><strong>Project Page (CMS)</strong> – Individual case studies or project breakdowns with depth.</p></li><li><p><strong>Insights (CMS)</strong> – Publish articles, case studies, or industry notes to build authority.</p></li><li><p><strong>Insight Page (CMS)</strong> – A full content view for articles or thought leadership.</p></li><li><p><strong>Contact</strong> – Conversion-ready forms to make inquiries simple and direct.</p></li><li><p><strong>Testimonials (CMS)</strong> – Share client feedback and social proof that builds trust.</p></li><li><p><strong>FAQ</strong> – Address common questions to reduce hesitation and build confidence.</p></li><li><p><strong>Legal (CMS)</strong> – Structured content for policies, terms, and compliance.</p></li><li><p><strong>404</strong> – A thoughtful error page that maintains user flow and personality.</p></li></ul><h3>Features at a Glance</h3><ul><li><p><strong>Light &amp; Dark Theme</strong> for flexibility and brand expression</p></li><li><p><strong>Slideshow &amp; Ticker</strong> for motion and dynamic content</p></li><li><p><strong>Sticky Scrolling &amp; Scroll Sections</strong> for fluid navigation</p></li><li><p><strong>Custom Cursors &amp; Effects</strong> for personality and uniqueness</p></li><li><p><strong>CMS-Powered Content</strong> for services, projects, insights, and more</p></li><li><p><strong>Forms</strong> for easy communication and lead capture</p></li><li><p><strong>Responsive Design &amp; Breakpoints</strong> for all devices</p></li><li><p><strong>Workshop Components</strong> for extended customization and scalability</p></li><li><p><strong>A11y Optimized &amp; SEO Ready</strong> for inclusivity and discoverability</p></li></ul><h3>Conclusion</h3><p>Quomi is more than a portfolio template — it’s a comprehensive digital toolkit for creatives and agencies ready to present their work with impact. By combining modern aesthetics, flexible CMS collections, and innovative features like light/dark themes and workshop code components, Quomi ensures your portfolio not only showcases your work but also communicates your value. Whether you’re a freelancer, studio, or agency, Quomi transforms your online presence into a story-driven, conversion-focused platform built for growth.</p>",
